{"4832050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Entered", "steam_appid": 4832050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>My ordinary life as a freshman in the Literature Club suddenly began to unravel one day.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Yeah, that notebook...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Entered&gt; </strong>is a retro-style horror visual novel set in a high school literature club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take the role of a new club member and experience a series of strange incidents unfolding within the club as the story progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices determine the path ahead, branching into multiple routes where entirely different horrors and truths await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each route explores a different horror subgenre—psychological horror, mystery, occult horror, and more—while the fates of the characters and the endings change accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What exactly has &quot;entered&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Retro CRT monitor-style 4:3 aspect ratio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 256-color VGA pixel graphics with scanline effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Extensive use of FMV-style video sequences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A visual novel where the story changes based on player choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Multiple horror experiences spanning psychological horror, mystery, occult horror, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Character fates and endings that vary depending on the route</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(The demo includes one complete route from beginning to end!)</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>My ordinary life as a freshman in the Literature Club suddenly began to unravel one day.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Yeah, that notebook...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Entered&gt; </strong>is a retro-style horror visual novel set in a high school literature club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take the role of a new club member and experience a series of strange incidents unfolding within the club as the story progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices determine the path ahead, branching into multiple routes where entirely different horrors and truths await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each route explores a different horror subgenre—psychological horror, mystery, occult horror, and more—while the fates of the characters and the endings change accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What exactly has &quot;entered&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Retro CRT monitor-style 4:3 aspect ratio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 256-color VGA pixel graphics with scanline effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Extensive use of FMV-style video sequences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A visual novel where the story changes based on player choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Multiple horror experiences spanning psychological horror, mystery, occult horror, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Character fates and endings that vary depending on the route</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(The demo includes one complete route from beginning to end!)</strong></p>", "short_description": "Entered ■■■■■■■... A retro-style horror visual novel branching into various horror subgenres.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832050/014c0c61f5045cae6adff11e859234b88340625d/he